# Validation gates

Every analysis script must:

- Print first/last date of every pulled series before transforms.
- Save raw pulled data to outputs/raw/ as Parquet (cheap re-runs).
- Save final figure-data to outputs/processed/ alongside the PNG.
- If replicating a paper, include a correlation check vs the reported
  series (target ≥0.95) and print it. Flag if below 0.90.
- Use pathlib for all paths. No hardcoded absolute paths.
